{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301170","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230117001:1":{"text":"좋죠. 저에게는 확실히 잘 맞는 일입니다.","source_cn":"修船很好，对于我来说确实是份好工作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x114296C7866553F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230117002:1":{"text":"20년 넘게 이 일을 해왔고, 러스트 항 부두를 지키는 일에 이미 익숙해졌어요.","source_cn":"我干这行已经二十多年了，我已经习惯这份守着锈锚港船坞的工作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF88FA0E0CF426A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230117003:1":{"text":"하지만 지금 벌이로는 가족을 먹여 살리기 힘들다면...","source_cn":"可是如果这份工作的酬劳无法为我的家人支付牛奶和面包……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8539B76292F76EDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230117004:1":{"text":"아무래도, 생각을 바꿔야 할 때가 온 것 같아요.","source_cn":"我想，是时候考虑改变了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88AC340901964ABF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠埃隆阿":{"text":"장인 에로나","source":"工匠埃隆阿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}